%N A392715 Decimal expansion of the maximum value of f(x) = 1/(4*x^2*cosh(1/(2*x))^2) for x > 0.
%C A392715 Value of the maximum of the ratio of the molar heat capacity and N_A*epsilon in a two-state system as a function of k_B*T/epsilon, where N_A is the Avogadro's constant, k_B is the Boltzmann's constant, T is the absolute temperature, and epsilon is the energy level difference between the two states (see Callen on pages 337-339).
%D A392715 Herbert B. Callen, Thermodynamics and an Introduction to the Thermostatistics, 2nd edition, John Wiley & Sons, Inc. (1985).
%H A392715 <a href="/index/Tra#transcendental">Index entries for transcendental numbers</a>.
